      "text": [
        "Drum Circles stand in the open in the Highlands, easy to spot from a ridge. In the middle is the **Silent Drum**; its keeper, [The Unsung](the_unsung), sleeps until someone plays it.",
        "A chest among the pillars always holds a **Music Disc** of the circle's four-beat, along with bones, candles, Echo Shards and sometimes a Bone Chime. Two Lore Tablets hang nearby.",
        "Before you strike: bind a return compass, and bring food, armour, charged Pulse cells and a Bone Chime. Bring a friend if you can; the fight lasts a few minutes."
      ],
